From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: squeezefs venue <venue@sqz.invalid>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 09:57:36 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] drm/amd/display: Restore FreeSync VCP code check for
 HDMI/PCON sinks

Omarchy 0478-amd-freesync-vcp-code-check-hdmi-pcon.patch (omacom/omarchy-pkgs
99aa5aa, pkgbuilds/linux-omarchy); upstream submission: amd-gfx, September 2026,
"[PATCH 52/64] drm/amd/display: Restore FreeSync VCP code check for HDMI/PCON
sinks" (Fixes: "drm/amd/display: Consult MCCS FreeSync cap only if requested &
supported"). An HDMI or whitelisted-PCON sink without an EDID FreeSync VCP code
is not FreeSync-capable; that check was lost when the MCCS handling moved under
do_mccs, so it is restored outside it.

ported to 7.3.1: the hunk is unchanged; it moves from amdgpu_dm.c to
amdgpu_dm_update_freesync_caps() in amdgpu_dm_connector.c (7.3 split amdgpu_dm.c
upstream). 7.3.1 does not carry the fix (its only VCP test is inside do_mccs).
The submission's KUnit test updates are not part of Omarchy's patch; 7.3.1 has
no such tests. As in Omarchy, this runs after 0450's HF-VSDB fallback, so an
HDMI TMDS sink without an AMD VSDB stays not FreeSync-capable.
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/amd/display/amdgpu_dm/amdgpu_dm_connector.c | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/amd/display/amdgpu_dm/amdgpu_dm_connector.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/amd/display/amdgpu_dm/amdgpu_dm_connector.c
index 67fcc288a..2b34890db 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/amd/display/amdgpu_dm/amdgpu_dm_connector.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/amd/display/amdgpu_dm/amdgpu_dm_connector.c
@@ -4051,6 +4051,12 @@ void amdgpu_dm_update_freesync_caps(struct drm_connector *connector,
 		}
 	}
 
+	/* HDMI/PCON without an EDID FreeSync VCP code is not FreeSync-capable. */
+	if ((sink->sink_signal == SIGNAL_TYPE_HDMI_TYPE_A ||
+	     as_type == FREESYNC_TYPE_PCON_IN_WHITELIST) &&
+	    !sink->edid_caps.freesync_vcp_code)
+		freesync_capable = false;
+
 	/* Handle MCCS */
 	if (do_mccs) {
 		dm_helpers_read_mccs_caps(adev->dm.dc->ctx, amdgpu_dm_connector->dc_link, sink);
